  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>List I</td>\t\t\t<td>List II</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>XeF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>I.See-saw</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>SF</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>II. Square planar</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi>NH</mi><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo></msubsup></math></td>\t\t\t<td>III. Bent <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>-</mo></math> shaped</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D.<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>BrF</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV. Tetrahedral</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below :</p>",
    "image": null
